SUMMARY:Deadline 23:55 CET: ARCHAIVE International Open Call: Artist Reside
 ncies on AI and Cultural Memory 2027
DESCRIPTION:Closes 07 Dec 2026 at 23:55 CET.\n\nARCHAIVE\, a Creative Europ
 e project led by MEET Digital Culture Center in Milan with NewArt Foundati
 on (Barcelona)\, Museu Zer0 (Tavira)\, Netherlands Institute for Sound & V
 ision and PUBLIC ART LAB (Berlin)\, invites emerging and mid-career artist
 s to engage critically with generative AI through cultural memory: how AI 
 reads\, completes and distorts shared heritage.\n\nOrganisation: ARCHAIVE 
 consortium (MEET Digital Culture Center\, NewArt Foundation\, Museu Zer0\,
  Sound & Vision\, PUBLIC ART LAB)\nLocation: Italy\, Spain\, Portugal\, Ne
 therlands and Germany (in person or hybrid\, depending on host). Open to n
 ationals or residents of Creative Europe countries.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 art
 ist fee per artist\, paid in instalments\, plus travel and accommodation c
 overed by a separate production budget\; 10 hours of technical mentoring p
 er artist. No application fee.\nDuration: Residencies between March and De
 cember 2027\, in person or hybrid depending on the host\n\nMore: https://a
 rchaive.eu/news/international-open-call-for-artists/?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://archaive.eu/news/international-open-call-for-artists/?utm_sourc
 e=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Italy\, Spain\, Portugal\, Netherlands and Germany (in person or h
 ybrid\, depending on host). Open to nationals or residents of Creative Eur
 ope countries.
END:VEVENT
