 to the Research Institute for Sustainability (RIFS) in Potsdam to work alo
 ngside researchers on sustainability and planetary transitions. Run since 
 2025 by RIFS at GFZ\, the City of Potsdam and the DAAD Artists-in-Berlin P
 rogram.\n\nOrganisation: Research Institute for Sustainability (RIFS) at G
 FZ\, with the City of Potsdam and the DAAD Artists-in-Berlin Program\nLoca
 tion: Potsdam\, Germany. In person. Open to artists in any field\; no nati
 onality or residence requirement stated.\nAward: Monthly stipend of EUR 2\
 ,500\, plus a lump sum for travel to Potsdam and back\, and up to EUR 5\,0
 00 housing support if you stay in Potsdam. No application fee stated.\nDur
 ation: At least 4 and ideally up to 6 months\, starting mid-2027\n\nMore: 
 https://www.rifs-potsdam.de/en/node/12558?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.rifs-potsdam.de/en/node/12558?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Potsdam\, Germany. In person. Open to artists in any field\; no na
 tionality or residence requirement stated.
END:VEVENT
